<title>BENIN: Cholera kills six people in Benin main city.</title>
<headline>Cholera kills six people in Benin main city.</headline>
<dateline>COTONOU 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>An outbreak of rainy-season cholera in Benin's commercial capital Cotonou has killed six people, medical officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The six, among 37 recorded cases in the city, died between Friday and Monday, they added.</p>
<p>Torrential rains fell in Cotonou in June. A further five people died in incidents linked to flooding.</p>
